      "tag": "Stop 1",
      "h2": "Sales forecast",
      "body_html": "<p class=\"big\">A <span class=\"hl p\">sales forecast</span> guesses how much you'll sell.</p><p>Use research and similar businesses for clues. Don't be too optimistic — banks see through it. 👀</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Stop 2",
      "h2": "Setting a budget",
      "body_html": "<p>A <span class=\"hl p\">budget</span> is your spending plan.</p><p>List every cost: stock, wages, rent, ads. Stick to the total.</p><p>If actual costs go over → that's a <b>variance</b>. Fix it fast.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Stop 3",
      "h2": "Best and worst case",
      "body_html": "<p>Smart plans show three numbers:</p><ul><li><span class=\"hl y\">Worst case</span> — flop.</li><li>Most likely.</li><li><span class=\"hl y\">Best case</span> — viral.</li></ul><p>If even the worst case still works, the idea is solid. 💪</p>"
    }
